    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d372">

                <pb facs="0542" n="500" xml:id="pg500"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 28, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to the correspondence which
                    has passed between us relative to the capture of the Elias Reed, I have the
                    honor to transmit to you an attested copy of an affidavit made by two of the
                    crew at Nassau. This document, has been sent to me by Messrs. Saunders &amp;
                    Son, of that place. I beg you to be so good as to return it to me.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest respect, sir, your most obedient, humble
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. H. Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
